                                                "sense_id": "33c14937-6bcd-33b1-a5ed-cb0ffdbaba6c",
                                                "text": "He soon exhausted pleasure, and then reasoned upon it: he soon exhausted it, because he wanted that colouring enthusiasm which creates more than half of what it enjoys;..."
